@startuml
title UC-PR Procure up to the award (cohort B)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber
actor "BAC, its Secretariat and tech…" as ROLE_BAC
boundary "BAC and procurement unit" as B_UNIT_NGA_BAC
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_BAC
participant "GPPB online submission form" as N_SYS_GPPB_FORM
entity "BTMS: 1 Commitment and obliga…" as E_MOD_BTMS_COM
participant "PhilGEPS (modernized): Electr…" as N_MOD_PG_BB
actor "Procurement Service of DBM" as ROLE_PSDBM
boundary "PhilGEPS (modernized)" as B_SYS_PHILGEPS
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_PSDBM
participant "Suppliers and payees" as N_EXT_SUPPLIER
participant "Any person" as N_UNIT_PUB_ANY
actor "Supplier or contractor" as ROLE_SUPPLIER
boundary "Suppliers and payees" as B_EXT_SUPPLIER
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_SUPPLIER
entity "PhilGEPS (modernized): Electr…" as E_MOD_PG_EBID
actor "Head of agency or authorized…" as ROLE_HEAD
boundary "Head of agency" as B_UNIT_NGA_HEAD
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_HEAD
entity "PhilGEPS (modernized)" as E_SYS_PHILGEPS
participant "BTMS: 1 Commitment and obliga…" as N_MOD_BTMS_COM
== PR-01 Submit the procurement plan and monitoring report ==
ROLE_BAC -> B_UNIT_NGA_BAC : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_BAC -> C_not_stated_ROLE_BAC : Submit the procurement plan and monitoring report
C_not_stated_ROLE_BAC -> N_SYS_GPPB_FORM : F041 Annual Procurement Plan and monitoring report at the GPPB
C_not_stated_ROLE_BAC -> E_MOD_BTMS_COM : read: Need ready: purchase request and a line in the procurement…
== PR-02 Post the invitation to bid ==
ROLE_BAC -> B_UNIT_NGA_BAC : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_BAC -> C_not_stated_ROLE_BAC : Post the invitation to bid
C_not_stated_ROLE_BAC -> N_MOD_PG_BB : F013 Invitation to bid posted in PhilGEPS
C_not_stated_ROLE_BAC -> E_MOD_BTMS_COM : read: Need ready: purchase request and a line in the procurement…
== PR-03 Show the opportunity and publish open data ==
ROLE_PSDBM -> B_SYS_PHILGEPS : System or office where the act takes place
B_SYS_PHILGEPS -> C_not_stated_ROLE_PSDBM : Show the opportunity and publish open data
C_not_stated_ROLE_PSDBM -> N_EXT_SUPPLIER : F014 Opportunity visible to registered suppliers
C_not_stated_ROLE_PSDBM -> N_UNIT_PUB_ANY : F103 Notice and award in the open data of PhilGEPS
== PR-04 Submit and open the bids ==
ROLE_SUPPLIER -> B_EXT_SUPPLIER : System or office where the act takes place
B_EXT_SUPPLIER -> C_not_stated_ROLE_SUPPLIER : Submit and open the bids
C_not_stated_ROLE_SUPPLIER -> E_MOD_PG_EBID : write: Bids received and opened
== PR-05 Evaluate, recommend and award ==
ROLE_HEAD -> B_UNIT_NGA_HEAD : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_HEAD -> C_not_stated_ROLE_HEAD : Evaluate, recommend and award
note right of C_not_stated_ROLE_HEAD : R-FUNDS-AWARD: No award before the funding is effective
C_not_stated_ROLE_HEAD -> E_MOD_PG_EBID : use: Bids received and opened
C_not_stated_ROLE_HEAD -> E_MOD_BTMS_COM : use: Need ready: purchase request and a line in the procurement…
C_not_stated_ROLE_HEAD -> E_SYS_PHILGEPS : write: Award made
C_not_stated_ROLE_HEAD -> N_MOD_PG_BB : F013 Award posted in PhilGEPS
== PR-06 Pass procurement data to BTMS (planned) ==
ROLE_PSDBM -> B_SYS_PHILGEPS : System or office where the act takes place
B_SYS_PHILGEPS -> C_not_stated_ROLE_PSDBM : Pass procurement data to BTMS (planned)
C_not_stated_ROLE_PSDBM -> N_MOD_BTMS_COM : F026 Procurement data passed to BTMS
@enduml
